herdr-files

mods/herdr-files/ is a copy of the files mod from Herdr
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app, defaults/mods/files/ at tag
v0.1.16, with its changes up to tag v0.1.18 brought in), licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.

It was copied with Herdr's `mod.clone` command, which changes the icon
paths in main.js and adds `cloned_from` to mod.json. Later changes are in
this repository's git history.

The icons in mods/herdr-files/ are Lucide icons under the ISC License.
chevron-down and chevron-right come from Feather, under the MIT License.
Both licenses are in mods/herdr-files/LICENSE-Lucide.txt.

The herdr-files program in the release archives is built from
crates/herdr-files/ and the crates it depends on. Most of those crates
offer the Apache License 2.0 or the Unlicense, and are used under one
of them. The parts below need notices of their own. The version of
each crate is the one in Cargo.lock at the release's tag.

